	(text "PORTS\nUART sensor port on J1 (Harness sheet): pin 3 TX, pin 4 RX, pin 2 GND,\npin 11 = 5 V, 200 mA via F801 polyfuse (shared with AIN1 sensors).\nUART2 = GPIO17 TX (3.3 V out via R801 100R) / GPIO16 RX via U801 74LVC1G17\n(5 V-tolerant input, R802 keeps it idle-high). U802 SRV05-4 = ESD on the\nfour external UART/GPS lines. The port data lines are 3.3/5 V logic:\nthey survive ESD, not a wire to the vehicle supply."
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2a1a5df0-93e7-47d8-b228-d56e51d68598")
	)
